If you have a way to get by the trap doors just go find the
upstairs on the left side of the screen. The obvious ways to
bypass the traps are floating, flying and jumping. You might
be able to fill some of the holes but don't fill them all.

You don't always fall in but it would take many, many
attempts to escape 5 traps in a row.

There are two ways to travel between levels but it might
take years to stumble across these without being told. A few
quest artifacts also provide inter level transport.

Hope that wasn't too spoily for you, good luck.

